    <string name="privacy_note">Local-first: data never leaves this device. No audio, photos, contacts or precise location are collected. Camera and microphone-in-use detection is live-only while Sentinel runs; historical cross-app use is not observable without privileged access. The optional permission watch (accessibility) records system permission dialogs and window switches only, never app screen content.</string>
    <string name="privacy_note_short">Records stay on this device. No audio, photos, contacts, clipboard contents, or sensor samples are collected.</string>
